features.description:
@src/generated/backend/models/UserProfileLifestyleModel.ts now has new fields 'motivationText' and 'motivationTextEvening'.
Before the options for the Energy selection are shown (morning check in) - send 'motivationText' and proceed after the standard sleep delay.
After the user completes the evening check in  (i.e. clicks Finish) - send 'motivationTextEvening'.

@src/generated/backend/models/GoalModel.ts now contains 'confirmationText' - if it's set we want to send it back to the user after the macro goal is created in @src/actions/actionMacroGoal.ts .
If it's not set the message should say:
“Perfect — I recorded your goal. I’ll keep you on track.”
